{
  "name": "monthly-nth-weekday-zero-is-every-such-weekday",
  "note": "An `nth` of ZERO is a third arm, not a degenerate one: the crate maps it to NWeekday::Every, so this is EVERY Friday of every month — 26 firings where the nth arms give six. A client that treated 0 as unplaceable would render a live weekly-ish schedule as 'nothing is scheduled'.",
